# QUIRK: a source placed directly in channels of two video mixes with mix_audio set is a root node twice and is therefore mixed twice (doubled amplitude); the same source twice in one view likewise.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
timeline 1000000000
source a input
video_mix 1
video_mix 1
channel 0 0 a
channel 1 0 a
channel 1 5 a
set a active 1
output a 48000 2 1024 1000000000 const 0.25
run 1 1
